ng soft cat"},{"w":"swing","m":"a seat that moves back"},{"w":"blossom","m":"a flower on a plant"},{"w":"hammock","m":"a hanging bed for resting"},{"w":"sprout","m":"a tiny new plant"},{"w":"petal","m":"a soft part of a flower"},{"w":"hedge","m":"a row of small bushes"},{"w":"meadow","m":"a field of grass and flowers"},{"w":"pond","m":"a small pool of water"},{"w":"sunflower","m":"a tall bright yellow flower"},{"w":"butterfly","m":"a pretty winged insect"},{"w":"ladybug","m":"a small red spotted beetle"},{"w":"rabbit","m":"a soft and hopping animal"},{"w":"hamster","m":"a small furry pet"},{"w":"goldfish","m":"a small orange pet fish"},{"w":"parrot","m":"a colorful talking bird"},{"w":"kennel","m":"a small house for a dog"},{"w":"leash","m":"a strap for walking a dog"},{"w":"seedling","m":"a young growing plant"},{"w":"harvest","m":"to gather the ripe crops"},{"w":"orchard","m":"a field of fruit trees"},{"w":"watering","m":"giving plants a cool drink"},{"w":"bloom","m":"to open into a flower"},{"w":"vine","m":"a plant that climbs upward"},{"w":"bush","m":"a small leafy plant"},{"w":"robin","m":"a friendly garden bird"},{"w":"reunion","m":"a happy family gathering"},{"w":"blessing","m":"a gift of good wishes"},{"w":"surprise","m":"a happy unexpected treat"},{"w":"festival","m":"a joyful public celebration"},{"w":"parade","m":"a happy march with music"},{"w":"ribbon","m":"a strip for wrapping gifts"},{"w":"feast","m":"a large and happy meal"},{"w":"gather","m":"to come together as one"},{"w":"celebrate","m":"to honor a special day"},{"w":"tradition","m":"a custom passed down"},{"w":"photo","m":"a picture of happy times"},{"w":"album","m":"a book that holds photos"},{"w":"greeting","m":"a kind hello to someone"},{"w":"invite","m":"to ask someone to come"},{"w":"lantern","m":"a lamp carried in hand"},{"w":"confetti","m":"tiny bits of colored paper"},{"w":"wreath","m":"a ring of leaves and flowers"}],"sentences":["I love my family very much.","We help each other at home.","My mom reads me a story at bedtime.","Dad and I cook dinner together.","We hug when we feel sad.","My sister shares her toys with me.","Grandma bakes a sweet cake for us.","We keep our bedroom clean and tidy.","The whole family plays games after dinner.","My brother helps me with my homework.","We say thank you when someone is kind.","Grandpa tells us funny stories.","I set the table for lunch.","We water the plants in the garden.","My baby cousin likes to laugh and smile.","We wash the dishes as a team.","On my birthday we have a happy party.","Our pet dog sleeps near my bed.","We visit our grandma every weekend.","Mom gives me a warm hug before school.","We are kind and gentle with each other.","Family makes our home feel safe and cozy.","Can you help me fold the clothes?","Who wants to bake cookies with me?","What a happy day we had together!","We sweep the floor and make it shine.","I feel proud of my loving family.","Let us all share a big meal.","We cook dinner together on Fridays.","Helping at home shows we care.","Grandma tells us gentle bedtime stories.","We plant bright flowers in the garden.","The whole family shares a warm meal.","My brother and I wash the dishes.","We fold the blankets after breakfast.","Our puppy waits by the front door.","Can you pass the fresh bread, please?","We decorate the house for the birthday party.","Kindness grows when we share with others.","Let us thank our neighbors for their help.","We gather around the table to pray.","The kitten naps on a soft cushion.","We bake muffins for the family reunion.","Being patient helps our home stay calm.","My cousin visits us every summer.","We sweep the hallway and dust the shelves.","What a joyful surprise for our grandma!","We water the garden every sunny morning.","Sharing chores makes the work feel light.","The children giggle during the picnic.","We welcome every guest with a warm smile.","Honest words build trust in our family.","We hang bright ribbons for the celebration.","A gentle hug can comfort a sad friend.","Thank you for the lovely present!"]}